{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01D4TK1qzqKWvpRGVA8PBKEW","type":"tool_result","content":"238\tvoid picoquic_update_pacing_data_after_send(picoquic_pacing_t * pacing, size_t length, size_t send_mtu, uint64_t current_time)\n239\t{\n240\t    uint64_t packet_time_nanosec;\n241\t\n242\t    picoquic_update_pacing_bucket(pacing, current_time);\n243\t    packet_time_nanosec = ((pacing->packet_time_nanosec * (uint64_t)length) + (send_mtu - 1)) / send_mtu;\n244\t    pacing->bucket_nanosec -= packet_time_nanosec;\n245\t}\n246\t\n247\t/* Interface functions for compatibility with old implementation */\n248\tvoid picoquic_update_pacing_after_send(picoquic_path_t* path_x, size_t length, uint64_t current_time)\n249\t{\n250\t    picoquic_update_pacing_data_after_send(&path_x->pacing, length, path_x->send_mtu, current_time);\n251\t}\n252\t\n253\tint picoquic_is_sending_authorized_by_pacing(picoquic_cnx_t* cnx, picoquic_path_t* path_x, uint64_t current_time, uint64_t* next_time)\n254\t{\n255\t    return picoquic_is_authorized_by_pacing(&path_x->pacing, current_time, next_time, cnx->quic->packet_train_mode,\n256\t        cnx->quic);\n257\t}\n258\t\n259\t/* Reset pacing data if congestion algorithm computes it directly */\n260\tvoid picoquic_update_pacing_rate(picoquic_path_t* path_x, double pacing_rate, uint64_t quantum)\n261\t{\n262\t    picoquic_update_pacing_parameters(&path_x->pacing, pacing_rate,\n263\t        quantum, path_x->send_mtu, path_x->smoothed_rtt, path_x);\n264\t}\n265\t/* Reset pacing if expressed as CWIN and RTT */\n266\tvoid picoquic_update_pacing_data(picoquic_path_t* path_x, int slow_start)\n267\t{\n268\t    picoquic_update_pacing_window(&path_x->pacing, slow_start, path_x->cwin, path_x->send_mtu, path_x->smoothed_rtt,\n269\t        path_x);\n270\t}\n271\t"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"36feb9dd-a64c-482f-8d2d-3dfde6f4c9e3","uuid":"be649779-153f-4c8d-9230-7f1c2aa85182","timestamp":"2026-05-07T13:39:49.724Z","tool_use_result":{"type":"text","file":{"filePath":"/Users/richbarn/Projects/picoquic/picoquic/pacing.c","content":"void picoquic_update_pacing_data_after_send(picoquic_pacing_t * pacing, size_t length, size_t send_mtu, uint64_t current_time)\n{\n    uint64_t packet_time_nanosec;\n\n    picoquic_update_pacing_bucket(pacing, current_time);\n    packet_time_nanosec = ((pacing->packet_time_nanosec * (uint64_t)length) + (send_mtu - 1)) / send_mtu;\n    pacing->bucket_nanosec -= packet_time_nanosec;\n}\n\n/* Interface functions for compatibility with old implementation */\nvoid picoquic_update_pacing_after_send(picoquic_path_t* path_x, size_t length, uint64_t current_time)\n{\n    picoquic_update_pacing_data_after_send(&path_x->pacing, length, path_x->send_mtu, current_time);\n}\n\nint picoquic_is_sending_authorized_by_pacing(picoquic_cnx_t* cnx, picoquic_path_t* path_x, uint64_t current_time, uint64_t* next_time)\n{\n    return picoquic_is_authorized_by_pacing(&path_x->pacing, current_time, next_time, cnx->quic->packet_train_mode,\n        cnx->quic);\n}\n\n/* Reset pacing data if congestion algorithm computes it directly */\nvoid picoquic_update_pacing_rate(picoquic_path_t* path_x, double pacing_rate, uint64_t quantum)\n{\n    picoquic_update_pacing_parameters(&path_x->pacing, pacing_rate,\n        quantum, path_x->send_mtu, path_x->smoothed_rtt, path_x);\n}\n/* Reset pacing if expressed as CWIN and RTT */\nvoid picoquic_update_pacing_data(picoquic_path_t* path_x, int slow_start)\n{\n    picoquic_update_pacing_window(&path_x->pacing, slow_start, path_x->cwin, path_x->send_mtu, path_x->smoothed_rtt,\n        path_x);\n}\n","numLines":34,"startLine":238,"totalLines":271}}}
